# Health OS Operating Rules

## Automated Merge & Deployment Rule
Whenever the user asks to "merge into main" or "merge to main":
1. Sync and verify: `npm run sync && npm run verify`
2. Merge into main branch: `git checkout main && git merge <branch>`
3. Redeploy to Cloudflare production: `npx wrangler deploy --env=""`
4. Push to remote: `git push origin main`
5. Report live production URL.
